   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "For those curious, my initials are JAM. I'm Jessica Amelinda Mang, a UI/UX designer who likes to experiment, make a mess, and create something worth serving.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "I believe design is a lot like cooking. You need the right ingredients, time to experiment, and plenty of taste testing before you know you've got the recipe right.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "So, welcome to my kitchen. Let's see what I've been cooking.",
